================================================================================
STUDIED CONTENT: not licensed, and not distributed
================================================================================

No text of any studied artifact is contained in this repository, and none is
redistributed under either licence above. Corpus manifests carry hashes,
offsets and source identifiers only. This is a security and ethics commitment
rather than a licensing convenience: the corpus under study includes adversarial
content engineered to influence language models, and republishing it would
extend its reach.

